stateDiagram-v2
    state "空闲" as Idle
    state "已派任务" as Tasked
    state "执行中" as Executing
    state "冷却" as Cooldown
    state "已烧毁" as Burned
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Tasked: assignTask()
    Tasked --> Executing: 开始执行
    Executing --> Cooldown: 任务完成
    Cooldown --> Idle: 冷却结束
    Executing --> Burned: 检测风险超阈值

